OL,3,GNEWSAA&E staff at 'absolute breaking
OL,4,Apoint', union says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union has warned frontline accident
OL,7,Fand emergency staff at an NHS trust
OL,8,Fwhich declared its fourth critical
OL,9,Fincident this year are at "absolute
OL,10,Fbreaking point".
OL,12,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)
OL,13,FNHS trust - which runs the Queen's
OL,14,FMedical Centre and Nottingham City
OL,15,FHospital - announced the critical
OL,16,Fincident on Tuesday, citing record
OL,17,Fnumbers of patients in its emergency
OL,18,Fdepartments. It was then stood down on
OL,19,FWednesday afternoon.
