OL,4,Apoint', union says
OL,5,
OL,6,FScott Weightman, of Unison East
OL,7,FMidlands, said critical incidents had
OL,8,Fput staff under "constant pressure".
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the trust said the
OL,11,F"safety and wellbeing of our staff,
OL,12,Fpatients and visitors is our first
OL,13,Fpriority".
